{"unit_id":2,"stage_id":2,"lesson":{"lesson_id":5,"lesson_key":"S2L5","stage_id":2,"title":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","en":"Preposition 'Min' (From / Of): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","ur":"حرفِ جر 'مِنْ' (سے): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","hi":"हर्फ़-ए-जर्र 'मिन' (से): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ"},"arabic_Focus":"الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ","hinglish_Focus":"Kitaab, Aasman → Kitaab se, Aasman se","page_numbers":"60–61","book_page":60,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ","hinglish":"Kitaab, Aasman → Kitaab se, Aasman se","arabic_word":"الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ","arabic_combined":"الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ","hinglish_word":"Kitaab, Aasman","hinglish_combined":"Kitaab, Aasman → Kitaab se, Aasman se","title_en":"Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","subtitle":"Unit 2 • Lesson 5 (Book Page 60–61)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ","after_ar":"مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ","before_hi":"Kitaab, Aasman","after_hi":"Kitaab se, Aasman se"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S2L5 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S2L5 — Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qaa'ida / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["مِنَ + الْـ (Zair ـِ)","مِنَ الْكِتَابِ / مِنَ السَّمَاءِ / مِنَ النَّاسِ","Kitaab se / Aasman se / Logon mein se"],["مِنْ + Nakirah (Do Zair ـٍ)","مِنْ مَاءٍ / مِنْ طِينٍ / مِنْ عِلْمٍ","Paani se / Mitti se / Kisi ilm se"],["مِنْ ba'd Ism-ut-Tafzeel","وَالْفِتْنَةُ أَكْبَرُ مِنَ الْقَتْلِ","Aur fitna qatl se bada hai ('se' muwazane ke liye)"]]}},{"id":"sec_s2l5_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 2 • LESSON 5</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr 'Min' (Se): الْكِتَابُ ← مِنَ الْكِتَابِ (Page 60–61)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Harf-e-Jarr (مِنْ + ـِ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْكِتَابُ ، السَّمَاءُ (Kitaab, Aasman) se مِنَ الْكِتَابِ ، مِنَ السَّمَاءِ (Kitaab se, Aasman se) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Huroof-e-Jarr, Inna, Laa, Illaa, Kaana aur Yaa Qur'ani jumlon ki buniyadi chabiyan hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 60–61):** **`مِنْ`** ka matlab **'se / mein se'** hai. Iske baad aane wale ism ke neeche **Zair (`ـِ / ـٍ`)** aati hai: `مِنَ الْكِتَابِ` (Kitaab se), `مِنْ طِينٍ` (mitti se)."}},{"id":"sec_s2l5_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Neeche di gayi misalon par ghaur karo:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l5_r4","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Upar ki misalon se wazeh hai ke (مِنْ) ke maani 'se' hain, aur iske baad aane wale lafz ke aakhir mein aam taur par zer (kasrah) aati hai. (مِنْ) aur iske baad wala lafz mil kar ek murakkab (phrase) bante hain aur isliye inka tarjuma ek saath hota hai. Yeh lafz Quran Majeed mein bohot zyada aaya hai."}},{"id":"sec_s2l5_r5","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Mein Quranic fiqron ko samjho aur tarjuma karo:"}},{"id":"sec_s2l5_g6","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s2l5_g6_w1","arabic":"مِنَ الدِّينِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الدِّينِ</span>","hinglish":"Deen se","translations":{"en":"From the religion","ur":"دین سے","hi":"दीन से"}},{"id":"s2l5_g6_w2","arabic":"مِنَ الْعِلْمِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْعِلْمِ</span>","hinglish":"Ilm se","translations":{"en":"From knowledge","ur":"علم سے","hi":"इल्म से"}},{"id":"s2l5_g6_w3","arabic":"مِنَ الْكِتَابِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الْكِتَابِ</span>","hinglish":"Kitaab se","translations":{"en":"From the Book","ur":"کتاب سے","hi":"किताब से"}},{"id":"s2l5_g6_w4","arabic":"مِنَ اللهِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">مِنَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهِ</span>","hin